msgstr "Foretrukket lydsprog"

msgid "Used by \"Preferred language only\" and by MP4, which keeps one track. Audio description tracks are skipped. Without a match the first track is recorded."
msgstr "Bruges af »Kun foretrukket sprog« og af MP4, der beholder ét spor. Spor med synstolkning springes over. Uden match optages det første spor."

msgid "{what}: {items} can only be kept in MPEG-TS, so recordings are saved as TS."
msgstr "{what}: {items} kan kun bevares i MPEG-TS, så optagelser gemmes som TS."

msgid "{what}: {items} can only be kept in TS or MKV, so recordings are saved as TS."
msgstr "{what}: {items} kan kun bevares i TS eller MKV, så optagelser gemmes som TS."

